comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-27T06:19:57.907Z","harness:codex","Review intake: CodeRabbit review 5037755674 found docs conflate the profile scaffold selector with manifest capabilities; the canonical design maps the profile archetype to schema rather than adding a profile manifest capability."
  "2026-08-27T06:29:52.142Z","harness:codex","TDD/red isolation evidence: the direct docs/skills gate passed, while its canonical linked run failed because the linked runner correctly replaced PM_PATH with an empty schema sandbox and nested guide processes then lacked the source PM_CLI_PACKAGE_ROOT. The supported fix binds only the CLI package/document root to the checkout while keeping PM_PATH and PM_GLOBAL_PATH isolated."
  "2026-08-27T06:47:19.092Z","harness:codex","Exact-head evidence: EXTENSIONS.md now distinguishes the profile scaffold selector from manifest capabilities, and the profile starter declares commands+schema, never profile. The docs gate now pins nested guide subprocesses to PM_CLI_PACKAGE_ROOT while leaving PM_PATH/PM_GLOBAL_PATH in the linked schema sandbox. Direct and canonical linked docs gates plus 23 regression tests passed; full repository quality and fresh temp profile scaffold acceptance passed."
